  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a black-and-white photograph of two men in military uniforms standing near a brick oven, one of whom is leaning over the oven while the other stands beside it. The text overlaid on the image reads: \"see? i fuckin told you!\" and \"little foil on top keeps them jewsy.\" The visual material is juxtaposed with the text to create a hateful and antisemitic message. The phrase \"keeps them jewsy\" is a derogatory and offensive stereotype that implies Jews are somehow 'kept' or preserved by foil, which is a direct attack on Jewish people based on their ethnicity and religion. This is a clear example of antisemitic hate speech, as it uses a historical and horrific context (the Holocaust) to perpetuate harmful stereotypes and dehumanize Jewish people. The overall intent is to spread hate and misinformation by invoking the Holocaust in a trivializing and offensive manner, which is a form of hateful content targeting a protected characteristic (Jewish identity).",
